    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61dcd978e0967b235076e646",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。\r\n新宇宙想告诉你关于“GATE”之后的事情。\r\n即使无法『接受』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0dacdbfdacb4912e88727a02b579d1332c711747633e026910fa07e125cad1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
