      "uid": "zhcn:43f40954196e0a7eec2cb264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也希望你能“FELT”。\r\n新宇宙这永恒的……“视界”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0092117fccd6b4487a92a78359e4b85d240f5878d2f884554f55da7ffb31e3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
