    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948f538b981159a9286e2c55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简直就像是我们的心灵已经连接在了一起一般。\r\n而且，我察觉到——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fbc2f20fe24b9de063bfd22926b7b9097f0d292c307bd04058b379228dd0c48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399f86722ca982a0bcc7bfe4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份心愿……祈愿……共生……的感觉，\r\n并非是今天才第一次诞生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d8f2aa135f2f2f5d7dea1786395015dcb9da90036a804ce81b0e4f25067a47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee30fa7c0daeb28cfc303b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "存在于所有宇宙中的，强烈的祈愿——",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc64818910e3f66a0ef4f6b409a4d84b75a7cdb54b1eee5ebc25ba335bd5b56a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd6a62252f43f55b4208eab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『想要一起——继续奔跑下去』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d2a41094f3fa37d3a41ff185090f1a73bd34211926380facbbbc2f21b67220",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1305cc35f7e879bd720593a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当晚，我们就下次目标比赛进行了一次协商。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ee4bdddd40dabd805c87eee64b301a3a9100d1b9b05452c1d5aa30a5c8e9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72568014332326f31652e5f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "距离命运的“GATE”——『天皇赏（春）』，\r\n还有一个半月。\r\n现在正是决断之时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6f47675b7f325d15f1c25c94971b4ba695c4107c54769602e48a0069c56fa7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
