      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。新宇宙现在可谓是，“俎上鱼肉”。\r\n『天皇赏（春）』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "caad94ae1bd0963f0a9c6d1d5f0470be16c0186c9e3f1b2a3e50524d062debec",
