      "uid": "zhcn:170237b0d01a5a107fc151fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还是把我的想法也挑明吧。\r\n我告诉她，也有着“并非消失，而是因为某种原\r\n因而看不见”的可能性存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81be3c4cea76c0f39c2646bcc6043aad1b754d29e2387c55ac633d886894d9d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
